  // ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
  // EFT 1.1.0.0 (Seasonal Character) quest experience rework, verified against
  // the 2026-08-12 PvE client capture (eft/eft-1.1-pve) and the wiki.
  //
  // BSG consolidated quest XP rewards to a small set of standard values in
  // patch 1.1.0.0; tarkov.dev synced most quests but still serves the old
  // per-quest value for the tasks below - in EVERY mode (regular/pve/pvp-season
  // all mirror the same stale number). Both the wiki (regular witness) and the
  // in-game capture (PvE witness) agree on the new value for these ten, so the
  // correction is shared and belongs in base. Each entry is recorded in
  // src/divergences/tasks.json5 (status: converged) so a future flip is
  // detected instead of silently shipping wrong data.
  // ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

